  "name": "Report the held-out split apart from development in the evaluation lab",
  "intent": "In the evaluation lab, report the development and held-out splits apart, so a support lead tuning the routing threshold sees how routing does on tickets it was not tuned against. A ticket's split is its label's split, else the saved prediction's split, else the split of its related incident (the label's incident first), else it is unassigned. Put the function in src/domain/splits.ts as evaluateBySplit(predictions, labels, threshold), returning the lab's own evaluateSaved result for each split and the IDs of unassigned tickets; export it from src/domain; and show each split's routing precision, coverage and ticket count beside the overall numbers in the evaluation lab. tests/evaluation-splits.test.ts says exactly what it must return.",
